        "original_id": "5d23fcec-4502-5dfd-a186-b6faf6e4dd84",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Virgin, Lukas Verzbicas, Chris Derrick, James Munyala\n- Sports: Illinois Boys Cross Country, triathlon\n- Places: Illinois, Kaunas, Lithuania\n\nFacts:\n- In 1972, Craig Virgin ran 13:50.6 in Illinois Boys Cross Country and remains the record-holder.\n- In 2007, Chris Derrick ran 13:51.8, which came within five seconds of Craig Virgin’s Illinois Boys Cross Country record.\n- Lukas Verzbicas was born as Lukas Veržbickas on January 6, 1993, in Kaunas, Lithuania.\n- In 2010, Lukas Verzbicas ran 13:53.8, which came within five seconds of Craig Virgin’s Illinois Boys Cross Country record.\n- Lukas Verzbicas is a Lithuanian-American triathlete.\n- At the time, Craig Virgin suggested that these athletes displaced opportunities for American athletes.",
